/**
 * @mainpage My Compiler
 *
 * @section intro Introduction
 * Welcome to the documentation for the Tomat0 compiler: 
 * A compiler for my custom programming language written in C.
 * 
 * You can find documentation on every file on this Doxygen site. 
 *
 * @section architecture Architecture Overview
 * The compiler is organized into the following stages:
 *
 * -# **Lexing** – Tokenizes raw source text into a stream of tokens.
 * -# **Parsing** + **Semantic Analysis** – Consumes the token stream and builds an Abstract Syntax Tree (AST) and performs type checking, scope resolution, and validation.
 * -# **Code Generation** – Emits ARM64 assembly.
 */